{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act54side_level_act54side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act54side","storySort":7,"storyDependence":"act54side_level_act54side_05_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SR-6","storyName":"月蚀","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"结城理从吉阿达那里得知了拉特兰律法毁灭的灾难、萨科塔的共感能力变化等事，逐渐理解了吉阿达和裘里奥分歧的深层原因。深夜，山岸风花感知到了空前强大的怪物气息，众人前往调查……","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act54side/level_act54side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act54side_06","minState":"UNLOCKED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["吉阿达","结城理","裘里奥","山岸风花","岳羽由加莉","天田乾","埃癸斯","虎狼丸"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"all","duration":"2","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5","focus":"all","duration":"2","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"结城？怎么来这么早。","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5","focus":"r","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"有事情想问吉阿达小姐。","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"昨天帮忙放文件时，我们看到了一些信息。","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"……请问，那位男性死者，他的死亡有可疑之处吗？","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"按照附件里的公证所简报来看，并没有疑点。是你们认识的人吗？","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#2$5","focus":"r","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"只是一面之缘……","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……做这一行是会碰到这种事，掀开盖布是一张见过的脸。在所难免。","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"如果你们很在意，我可以去申请调阅公证所的详细报告，虽然大概要在你们实习结束之后才会下发。","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"今年公证所很忙，像这样的额外申请可能不会太快。","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5","focus":"r","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"说到这一点……","id":27},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_avg_grandpilgrimage_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_grandpilgrimage_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":28,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#13$5","focus":"r","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"拉特兰发生什么事了吗？","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……拉特兰发生什么……","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"难道你指的是……不，看你这样子，应该还不知道。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……也是，你们到拉特兰还不久，这种事情其实没有人会专门提起吧。","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"虽然我也有点……不知要怎么讲起。","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"陪我去买杯咖啡吧。","id":38},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"curtain","direction":"3","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"1","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.7","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":41},{"type":"charslot","id":42},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":43},{"type":"curtain","direction":"3","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0.01","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":44},{"type":"curtain","direction":"7","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"1","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":45},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_bg_26_g9_laterano_street.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":46},{"type":"curtain","direction":"7","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0.01","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.7","id":47},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":48},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5","focus":"l","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我多买了一个甜甜圈，给你。甜甜圈的造型……现在在拉特兰应该挺常见吧。","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5","focus":"r","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"嗯，在甜食礼堂看到过这个形状的饼干。这是……积木拼成的圆环？","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"这是拉特兰的神。","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#13$5","focus":"r","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"……？","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"祂已经死了。去年秋天，刚刚死的。","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"这就是“律法”。现在被叫做“圣髑”，“神的遗骸”。","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我们没有见过律法“活着”的样子……我们刚刚得知祂存在，同时就被告知，祂死了。","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……当然了，也许萨科塔的感觉会不一样。也许他们一直都能感知到祂……","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"不过，对萨科塔来说更直接的麻烦应该是，他们不再能像过去那样共感了。","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……真是千头万绪。如果不是你问起，我大概也想不到要特意告诉你……需要解释的事太多了。","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"共感是萨科塔原本拥有的一种能力，你看到他们的光环了吧？光环让他们能够感受到彼此的情绪和情感。","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"所以你很难看到萨科塔产生矛盾，他们非常、非常容易彼此谅解……曾经是这样。","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"据说在少数关系亲密的萨科塔之间还存在共感，但一般情况下，萨科塔几乎都不再能感受到身边其他萨科塔的情绪了。","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我不知道这段时间你们对我和裘里奥的矛盾是怎么理解的……","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"裘里奥一直说，欢乐的葬礼是萨科塔的传统，对吧？","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"其实真正的传统不是“欢乐”。是因为萨科塔可以同悲同喜，所以即使在葬礼上，他们也可以随心所欲。","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"一个人的悲伤是所有人的悲伤，一个人的慰藉也能让所有人慰藉。","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"萨科塔很少懂得的一种感觉是“尴尬”。","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"现在，他们已经失去这种幸运了。","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我很高兴昨天最后你说服了裘里奥别搞那什么骨灰礼炮……他会让所有人都看起来像疯子的。","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……葬礼不该是那种样子。","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"就算以前是，现在也不该是了。","id":87},{"type":"dialog","id":88},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":93},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":94},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":96},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.5","id":97,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"吉阿达，你今天竟然踩点到，真稀奇！给你咖啡……","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":101},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"啊，你已经买了。","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……结城也在一起？你们不需要先在学校集合再过来吗？","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"我和班长打了招呼，提前过来了。","id":107},{"type":"charslot","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"难道说，吉阿达为了让结城支持自己，偷偷请结城吃东西？","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"没错，就是这样。","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"这样啊，那没有我的份吗？比起收买结城，收买我不是更直接吗？","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"因为没有用。每次和你“商量”完，你说再斟酌、再想想，然后呢？","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你还不如不要做出那副在考虑我的想法的样子。","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"可是，我是真的在考虑。即使没有改变结论，但我并不是“装作在考虑你的想法”。","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"固执己见这方面，我们俩不是一样的吗？","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"只是为了这件事，我们就得时时刻刻像敌人一样吗？我很喜欢吉阿达，不想这样对你。","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"吉阿达……我，我不明白你的表情。可以直接告诉我吗？","id":129},{"type":"charslot","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"听到这句话，吉阿达像是无法忍受似的闭上眼睛，却又把手搭在了裘里奥肩头。","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"裘里奥困惑地眨着眼睛，但吉阿达看不见。这只是很短的一瞬，只发生在两次眨眼之间。","id":132},{"type":"text","text":"吉阿达收回了手。","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你就是这样的人。","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我要先去冷藏间准备一下。你陪结城在这里等同伴吧，公平起见，你也可以趁现在“收买”他。","id":137},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":139},{"type":"charslot","duration":"2","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"嗯……所以我要怎么“收买”你比较好？","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#2$5","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"multiline","name":"结城理","text":"……回答我一个问题就好，可以吗？","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"multiline","name":"结城理","text":"吉阿达小姐是黎博利，而裘里奥是萨科塔……是这样吧。","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"能和我讲讲“共感”的事吗，那位姨妈会留下遗嘱让你在她的葬礼上举办派对，是因为你们之间的共感吗？","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"原来你对共感好奇啊。其实我可能不是很有发言权，毕竟我在国外待了很久，周围几乎没有萨科塔，共感好像就没那么重要了。","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"至于姨妈的遗嘱……唉，这件事我也很苦恼，完全想不起来为什么这位姨妈会立这样一个遗嘱……","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我好像记事比较晚，中学毕业之前，还在拉特兰生活时的事情，我已经不记得多少了。","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"但我一直很喜欢拉特兰！虽然只有模模糊糊的印象，但我小时候在拉特兰好像过得很充实、很开心。","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"在哥伦比亚，能共感的对象只有我爸爸。他是个忧心忡忡的人……","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"忧心忡忡的萨科塔，很少见吧？说不定他就是因为这个离开拉特兰的。","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"为了让他高兴点，我研究了很多笑话和戏法呢！","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"对我来说，共感最有用的就是这种时候了。我能感觉到他的心情真的变好了……","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我常常觉得，不是笑话逗乐了他，是因为他能从心底里感到，我现在很好，我希望他开心，他才少了一些担忧……","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"唔，说不定姨妈也是发现小时候的我很擅长让人开心，才立下了这个遗嘱！","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"一个快活的拉特兰人，就会希望大家在自己的葬礼上也能享受快乐，对吧？","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"所以……即使吉阿达的考虑有道理，有些事情我也想要坚持一下。","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……我们已经失去得够多了。如果还要被悲伤压倒无法自拔，那不是拉特兰。","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"就算是现在，这一点也不应该改变。","id":174},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":182},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"吉阿达小姐，好了吗？还没好吗？","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"没好，等着。","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"大家都已经到啦。","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"别催。","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":189},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wheelscree","channel":"wh","volume":"1","id":190},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairrub","volume":"0.8","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":193},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"唔……这就是维韦塔姨妈。吉阿达小姐之前连我都不让见……","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你还记得她的样子吗？","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……对不起……","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"但我也不是完全忘记了……应该……","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"唔……","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"嗯……姨妈她，喜欢吃泡芙吗？","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"那个……姨妈是不是没有别的亲人了？","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"像你这样的远房亲戚应该还有几位……她是典型的独身萨科塔，养父母也去世了。这种情况，后事都是六厅系统处置办理。","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"嗯，拉特兰人要么动不动从启言居所收养一堆孩子，要么是独身派，姨妈是后一种啊……","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"那个，今天是要整理遗容对吧，要不要找一些姨妈以前的照片，确定一下造型？","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你想做什么造型？","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"不要这么紧张……又不是只有夸张的类型。我只是想把姨妈打扮得漂亮一些，她是主角嘛！","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……不过，我也没有她的照片。姨妈的遗物现在是在哪里，吉阿达小姐知道吗？","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"其实，我在想……","id":224},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":225,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"修饰遗容，要做到何种程度呢？","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"基本的遗容整理，我已经做完了，但是……","id":227},{"type":"charslot","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"自吉阿达将遗体推到准备室，结城理就保持着沉默。","id":229},{"type":"text","text":"他用余光留意着同伴：埃癸斯平静地看着眼前的一切。风花别开了脸。","id":230},{"type":"text","text":"由加莉像是在强迫自己，僵硬地盯着死者的头发。天田乾低着头，看不清脸上的表情。","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"他们的脑海里，大概浮现出了同样的景象。但是，谁都没有提及那件事。","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"结城理看向那位素未谋面的死者。","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"她肤色青白，眼睑下有浓重的阴影，皮肤像是凝固的纸浆——绝不是“如同睡着了一般”。任何人都能清楚地看出来，她已经死了。","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"死者的脸上有种奇特的表情，不是痛苦，不是愤怒，不是茫然，什么都不是。","id":235},{"type":"text","text":"他突然意识到，也许是吉阿达做了什么，也许不久之前她才替她合上了眼睛。","id":236},{"type":"text","text":"所以，那不是一个“表情”。","id":237},{"type":"text","text":"那不是活着的人会露出的神态，那是被一双手捏合、对齐、抚平之后，一张已无生命的脸会成为的样子。那就是“死”的样子。","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……我应该为她化妆吗……这场葬礼……","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"吉阿达，我们还有一场派对呢，去派对怎么可以不化妆？","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"不做的话，姨妈肯定会责怪我们的~","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你是随口一说，还是真的这么想？","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……这不重要。死者不都要化妆的吗，这只是很普通的事吧？","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"其实不是。如果没有家属要见，也没有公开葬礼的话，是不必有这一步的。","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你不明白吗，裘里奥？死者已经死了，她不需要化妆，是活人需要死者化妆，是他们要看。","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"这……也没什么错吧？","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我们也不会因为死者漂亮生动就忘记她已经死掉了呀，都来参加葬礼了。难道非要见到死者死得透透的样子才好吗？","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……你能不要再开玩笑了吗。","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":261},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"抱、抱歉……","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":263},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"我只是觉得这件事没那么复杂，让姨妈漂漂亮亮地出现在自己的葬礼上，这能有什么错？","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"理，你说呢？","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"……","id":269},{"type":"dialog","id":270},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":271},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":272},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":273},{"type":"charslot","id":274},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":278,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"队长，要出发了……还在想今天的事吗？","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4219_yukari_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岳羽由加莉","text":"结城，你也不用太介怀啦……那本来也不是应该由我们，或者由你来决定的事。","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"之前你能帮他们两位解决争端，是因为他们有时争执到把自己困住了，你恰好能把他们两位从僵局里带出来……我是这样想的。","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"这也是为什么之前我觉得他们的矛盾并没有那么严重……如果只是有什么误会，那只要把话说开就好了，对吧……","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"但这一次……也许是不同的问题。","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"虽然裘里奥先生还是那副轻松的样子，但我渐渐觉得，他们两位其实都很认真……","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"……今天早上，我去找吉阿达小姐调查的时候，知道了一些事。","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"关于他们两人的分歧……还有，拉特兰此前发生的重大的变故。","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"也许那就是博士所说的，“拉特兰正在经历的变化”。","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2388_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"天田乾","text":"……到底发生了什么事？","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"拉特兰的“神”，几个月前刚刚死去……","id":297},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":300},{"type":"charslot","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":302},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岳羽由加莉","text":"……竟然发生了那样的事……","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4218_aigis_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃癸斯","text":"如果是这样的话，吉阿达小姐和裘里奥先生，他们的分歧也并不只是喜好上的差异。","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃癸斯","text":"而是因为两人都认为在现在的拉特兰，这场葬礼有着特殊的意义，但两人的观念又截然不同。","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2388_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"天田乾","text":"而且，拉特兰之所以会新建殡仪堂这样的设施，以及尝试改变葬仪的习俗，应该也与这件事有关吧……","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"他们两人对这场葬礼这么看重，大概也是因为这是他们面对如今的拉特兰的方式……","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2388_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"天田乾","text":"结城哥今天没有干涉他们两人的争端，也是因为这个吧。","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"嗯。","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"而且，我还在想另一个问题……","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"关于那种类似暗影的怪物。","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"既然拉特兰发生过这么重大的事件，那怪物的出现……会不会其实是与这个事件有关呢？","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4219_yukari_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岳羽由加莉","text":"因为神明死去了，所以出现了怪物吗……","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"嗯。而且，你们记得吧，博士很在意“长得像告解车的怪物”，还让我们整理了其他怪物的样子。","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"这么一说，有些怪物的样子，确实很有拉特兰特色……告解车更是只有拉特兰才有的东西，对吧？","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4219_yukari_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岳羽由加莉","text":"话是这么说，可是和我们有关系的方面也有很多吧……","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岳羽由加莉","text":"只有我们能看见怪物，人格面具能够和怪物战斗，还有街道异变的景象……这些又要怎么解释呢？","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":333},{"type":"multiline","name":"结城理","text":"只有继续调查下去才知道了……","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":335},{"type":"multiline","name":"结城理","text":"风花？","id":336},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"唔……","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岳羽由加莉","text":"风花，怎么了……是身体不舒服吗？","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"不……这是……怪物的气息！","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2388_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"天田乾","text":"什么？在宿舍附近吗？！","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"不……不在这附近。是非常强大的怪物气息，相隔这么远也能感觉到，非常强烈……","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4218_aigis_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃癸斯","text":"能判断具体的位置吗？","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"……应该，可以循着方向追踪过去。","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4220_kormr_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dogbarknormal","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"虎狼丸","text":"汪……！","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"那就出发吧，一定要找到它所在的地点。","id":356},{"type":"dialog","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":360},{"type":"charslot","id":361},{"type":"background","id":362},{"type":"image","id":363}],"characters":["吉阿达","结城理","裘里奥","山岸风花","岳羽由加莉","天田乾","埃癸斯","虎狼丸"]}